<b>An Individual Strategy - Changing the country one person at a time and starting with yourself.</b>

Part of Ancap's tradition comes strongly from the individualist tradition, or maybe better said, from that of individualist anarchism.

Discussion of some of the uniting and disuniting aspects can be found at [http://www.blackcrayon.com/ Black Crayon].

